  van: 'M4 10h15l4 5h5v7h-2a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-7 0h-6a3.5 3.5 0 1 1-7 0H4Zm2 2v8h.6a3.49 3.49 0 0 1 5.8 0H17V12Zm15 5-2.4-3H21v3ZM9.5 20a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3Zm14 0a1.5 1.5 0 1 0 0 3 1.5 1.5 0 0 0 0-3Z',
